<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech bourse says PX50 results delayed by fault.</title>
<headline>Czech bourse says PX50 results delayed by fault.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technical problems at the Prague bourse will delay Tuesday afternoon's PX50 index results, which are normally released just after 1500 GMT, by at least 15 minutes, the bourse said.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
